# {{name}}

A [fudic](https://github.com/fudiePlatform/fudic) style library: one global stylesheet,
`tokens.css`, and no components.

Every component of a project that uses it adopts `tokens.css` first, before its own sheets, so
what it declares on `:host` — custom properties — reaches all of them.

```sh
fudic add {{project}} --project <app or library>
```
